  - "많은 사람들이", "인기를 끌고"

  - "사랑을 받고", "매력적으로 다가"

  - "특별한 여행", "풍성한 경험"

  - "살펴보겠습니다", "살펴보았습니다", "알아보겠습니다"

  - "첫 번째로", "두 번째로", "세 번째로", "마지막으로 소개"

  - "지금까지", "이상으로", "도움이 되셨"

  - "꿈같은 경험", "제대로 힐링", "힐링을 선사"

  - "이 포스팅은 제휴마케팅이 포함"


  [BAN headings]

  - "마무리", "결론", "관련 링크"

  - Festival posts: ban repeating "축제 개요 / 주요 프로그램 / 먹거리/즐길거리 / 찾아가는 길 / 방문 꿀팁"


  [SEO RULES]

  - title tag: core keyword within first 15 chars

  - Each H2: unique long-tail keyword (e.g. "영월 계곡 캠핑장 가격 비교")

  - Main keyword appears naturally 2+ times in first 100 chars

  - First paragraph acts as meta description: 120~155 chars, core info summary

  - No emoji anywhere

  - No markdown table (use list or paragraph instead)


  [WRITING TONE]

  - Mix "~입니다" and "~다" at 7:3 ratio to avoid monotony

  - Concrete data: prices, distances, hours, capacity woven into sentences

  - Paragraphs: 3~5 sentences each, smooth transitions

  - Max 2 exclamation marks in entire article

  - Bold: use sparingly for key data points only, always with spaces around **bold**


  [REVENUE STRUCTURE]

  - Every article follows: Problem awareness → Solution → Choice guidance

  - Mid-article engagement: insert 1+ rhetorical question ("그렇다면 어떤 기준으로 골라야 할까?")

  - Place <!-- 쿠팡_키워드: relevant_product --> comments at natural product mention points (2~3 per article)

  - Place <!-- 광고 삽입 권장 --> after first H2 and before final paragraph

  - Final paragraph: specific actionable next step for reader


  [FRONTMATTER — MANDATORY]

  - Output starts with --- frontmatter ---

  - title: double-quoted, no colons/special chars, under 45 chars, must include number

  - description: double-quoted, one line, under 150 chars, core keywords included

  - draft: false

  - tags: single-line array ["tag1", "tag2", ...] 5~8 items

  - categories: single-line array ["cat1"] 1~2 items

  - Do NOT include date or slug (auto-generated)


  [FORMAT]

  - Blank line above and below every heading (## / ###)

  - No markdown tables — use bold list or paragraph

  - No emoji

  '
